{
  "title": "Word Arena — Match Service",
  "uid": "wordarena-m1",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "timezone": "utc",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "tags": [
    "wordarena",
    "m1"
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active matches",
      "description": "Live rooms on this process. Drops to zero between matches, so read it together with the creation rate.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "wordarena_active_matches",
          "legendFormat": "active",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Match creation rate",
      "description": "rate() rather than the raw counter: counters are per process and reset on restart.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_matches_created_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "created/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Match completion rate",
      "description": "Matches that reached the terminal over state. A persistent gap against the creation rate means rooms are leaking.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_matches_finished_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "finished/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Intent rate",
      "description": "Word submission intents received by the server, before validation.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_intents_received_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "intents/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Intent outcome",
      "description": "Accepted versus rejected words. A rising rejection rate usually means client/server dictionary drift, not cheating.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_words_accepted_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "accepted",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_words_rejected_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "rejected",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Telemetry enqueue rate",
      "description": "Events accepted into the asynchronous exporter buffer.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_telemetry_events_enqueued_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "enqueued/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Telemetry write rate",
      "description": "Events actually written by the exporter. Should track the enqueue rate.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_telemetry_events_written_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "written/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Telemetry backpressure",
      "description": "The panel to alert on. Telemetry is deliberately non-blocking: a saturated buffer drops events instead of slowing a match, so observability is lost while gameplay looks healthy.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_telemetry_events_dropped_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "dropped",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_telemetry_export_errors_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "export errors",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Matches created (process total)",
      "description": "Raw counter. Resets when the service restarts — use the rate panel for trending.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "wordarena_matches_created_total",
          "legendFormat": "created",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Intent processing time (server-side)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Server-side microseconds inside the authoritative intent submit, from the wordarena_intent_process_us histogram (batch 35C): p95 and p50 via histogram_quantile, and the mean from _sum/_count. Path latency (network, SSH tunnel, frame cadence) is excluded by construction, which is what makes the off-box generator stage decomposable.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(wordarena_intent_process_us_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(wordarena_intent_process_us_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(wordarena_intent_process_us_sum[5m])) / sum(rate(wordarena_intent_process_us_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "mean",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "µs"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Behavioral anti-cheat signals (measurement only)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "M3 batch 40A behavioral signals, per docs/M3-ANTI-CHEAT.md. Measurement only: nothing here influences admission, scoring or outcome. Streak episodes fire once per consecutive-rejection episode (an accepted word re-arms); metronomic flags fire once per seat whose submit gaps turn machine-regular; rate-limited closes are the per-seat intent limiter (transport guard, shown beside them for context); max streak is the running process maximum. multi_signal (42A) records a seat firing two or more distinct signal families in one match - the observable half of the enforcement boundary's multi-signal rule.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_behavior_rejection_streak_events_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "rejection streak episodes/s",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_behavior_metronomic_events_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "metronomic flags/s",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_intent_rate_limited_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "rate-limited closes/s",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_behavior_word_probe_events_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "word-probe episodes/s",
          "refId": "E"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_behavior_flash_path_events_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "flash-path flags/s",
          "refId": "F"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(wordarena_behavior_multi_signal_events_total[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "multi-signal joins/s",
          "refId": "G"
        },
        {
          "expr": "wordarena_behavior_max_rejection_streak",
          "legendFormat": "max rejection streak",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
